    <LongDescription>Mission database for FrontierSat (CTS-SAT-1) of CalgaryToSpace, written from the team's
        firmware: the 4-byte CSP header, the packet type, and the extended beacon v5+
        (COMMS_beacon_extended_packet_v5plus_t in misc_tools/exec_blob/extended_beacon_blob of
        github.com/CalgaryToSpace/CTS-SAT-1-OBC-Firmware). All payload fields are little-endian. The frame's
        CRC-32C trailer is removed before decoding. Other packet types end at the abstract root container.
    </LongDescription>
